      --  cfg_bl_mode = 0x0 - Fixed BL8 mode. 8 DDR transfers, 2 local side
      --  transfers per request cfg_bl_mode = 0x1 - BL8 or BC4 with on-the-fly
      --  selection cfg_bl_mode = 0x2 - Fixed BC4 (chop) (NOT CURRENTLY
      --  SUPPORTED) For "quarter-rate" configurations of the controller, there
      --  is only 1 local side transfer per request. Therefore, only one mode
      --  is supported: cfg_bl_mode = 0x0 - Fixed BL8 mode. 8 DDR transfers, 1
      --  local side transfers per request cfg_bl_mode = 0x1 - BL8 or BC4 with
      --  on-the-fly selection (NOT SUPPORTED) cfg_bl_mode = 0x2 - Fixed BC4
      --  (chop) (NOT SUPPORTED) Note: Refer to the SDRAM Controller Core User
